    "28": {
      "date": "2026-11-19",
      "edition": "Thursday 19 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Climate warning",
          "heading": "World Rugby report names Fiji among 10 countries facing climate threat",
          "body": "Climate change could leave rugby unplayable on more days, damage stadiums and pitches and heighten risks to players and spectators, a new World Rugby report warns. Fiji are among the 10 countries the report identifies as facing projected impacts, though today's coverage does not set out the specific findings for the islands. It lands as the Flying Fijians, beaten 15-43 by Ireland and winless in five Nations Championship tests, prepare to face Italy in Udine on Saturday."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Wales beat All Blacks 35-28",
