    "460": {
      "date": "2026-11-19",
      "edition": "Thursday 19 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Hooker injury",
          "heading": "Bautista Bernasconi reportedly ruled out of Pumas' France test with muscle injury",
          "body": "The Benetton hooker, who scored a first-half try in last Saturday's 19-14 win over Italy in Genoa, hurt a muscle in that match and has been left out of the Pumas camp in Paris, according to Argentine outlet Salida de 22 and others. The severity has not been reported. Fellow hookers Ignacio Ruiz and Leonel Oviedo are also injured. Julián Montoya, who missed the Italy game with concussion, appears to have cleared his latest checks."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Wales beat All Blacks 35-28",
